(Research Methodology Workflow:) Tj
T*
(* 1. Search Query Formulation: Use Boolean operators and truncation keywords: \("MIMO") Tj
T*
(OR "phased array"\) AND \("beamforming"\) AND \("5G" OR "6G"\).) Tj
T*
(* 2. Filtering by Publication Tier: Prioritize peer-reviewed IEEE Transactions \(e.g.) Tj
T*
(IEEE Transactions on Microwave Theory and Techniques, IEEE Transactions on VLSI) Tj
T*
(Systems\) and flagship conferences \(IEEE ISSCC, IEEE ICC\).) Tj
T*
(* 3. Citation Analysis: Inspect publication date \(focus on last 3-5 years\) and) Tj
T*
(citation count to identify seminal benchmark papers.) Tj
T*
(* 4. Synthesis & Referencing: Document literature matrix detailing author, proposed) Tj
T*
(architecture, performance metrics, and technological limitations to identify the open) Tj
T*
(research gap for the project.) Tj
T*
