(Context: Complete milestone roadmap for executing a student Capstone engineering) Tj
T*
(project.) Tj
T*
(Project Phase Breakdown:) Tj
T*
(* Phase 1 \(Problem Formulation & Feasibility\): Identify real-world problem; define) Tj
T*
(functional requirements; perform Bill of Materials \(BOM\) cost budgeting; verify) Tj
T*
(component availability.) Tj
T*
(* Phase 2 \(Design & Simulation\): Author behavioral circuit models in LTspice or) Tj
T*
(MATLAB/Simulink; verify digital modules in ModelSim/Vivado; achieve 100% simulation) Tj
T*
(validation before purchasing silicon.) Tj
T*
(* Phase 3 \(Hardware Fabrication\): Design custom PCB in KiCad; order fabrication;) Tj
T*
(assemble and solder components; develop modular firmware drivers with unit tests.) Tj
T*
(* Phase 4 \(Integration & Measurement\): Connect subsystems; measure electrical signals) Tj
T*
(with DSO and spectrum analyzers; collect empirical experimental data; compare against) Tj
T*
(simulation benchmarks.) Tj
T*
(* Phase 5 \(Documentation & Dissemination\): Draft comprehensive final technical) Tj
T*
(report; prepare professional poster and presentation slide deck; file patent) Tj
T*
(application if novelty is established.) Tj
T*
